  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Add minimum package publication age (\"cooldown\") support, matching NuGet's new `minPublishAgeHours` (.NET 11 SDK): `--min-publish-age-hours`, `UpdateOptions.MinPublishAgeHours` and `minPublishAgeHours` in `.updatrrc`, applied to every package source. NuGet's own settings in `nuget.config` aren't read yet. Versions published too recently aren't picked as update targets and are reported as skipped with the new `SkippedUpdateReason.MinimumPublishAge`.",
